      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you ready to back me up?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006500200079006F007500200072006500610064007900200074006F0020006200610063006B0020006D0065002000750070003F00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You got it!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200067006F007400200069007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wait a sec",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570061006900740020006100200073006500630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you’re going to help me, then HELP me! I feel\nlike my heart is gonna jump out of my chest...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Th-thank you...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068002D007400680061006E006B00200079006F0075002E002E002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My date really likes Purrloin...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo I went and caught one for her, but I haven’t\nhad time to get to know it, or Purrloin in general...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Meow!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065006F007700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Could you sit nearby and give me some pointers if\nneeded?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F0075006C006400200079006F007500200073006900740020006E0065006100720062007900200061006E0064002000670069007600650020006D006500200073006F006D006500200070006F0069006E0074006500720073002000690066000A006E00650065006400650064003F00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "She’ll be here soon...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf I can’t answer one of her questions, please tell\nme something good to say!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All you need in life are Purrloin, nice cafés, and\nstimulating conversation!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m sure you know what kind of Pokémon\nPurrloin is?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D0020007300750072006500200079006F00750020006B006E006F0077002000770068006100740020006B0069006E00640020006F006600200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A0050007500720072006C006F0069006E002000690073003F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Devious Pokémon",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006500760069006F0075007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cruel Pokémon",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043007200750065006C00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Intimidation Pokémon",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E00740069006D00690064006100740069006F006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Exactly! “Devious” describes Purrloin perfectly,\ndoesn’t it?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450078006100630074006C007900210020201C0044006500760069006F00750073201D002000640065007300630072006900620065007300200050007500720072006C006F0069006E00200070006500720066006500630074006C0079002C000A0064006F00650073006E20190074002000690074003F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Is that so? That doesn’t really sound like\nPurrloin...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900730020007400680061007400200073006F003F0020005400680061007400200064006F00650073006E201900740020007200650061006C006C007900200073006F0075006E00640020006C0069006B0065000A0050007500720072006C006F0069006E002E002E002E00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you know why Purrloin steals people’s things?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F00200079006F00750020006B006E006F0077002000770068007900200050007500720072006C006F0069006E00200073007400650061006C0073002000700065006F0070006C0065201900730020007400680069006E00670073003F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s in order to survive",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900742019007300200069006E0020006F007200640065007200200074006F002000730075007200760069007600650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It just does that for fun",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900740020006A00750073007400200064006F006500730020007400680061007400200066006F0072002000660075006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It doesn’t like Trainers",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007400200064006F00650073006E201900740020006C0069006B006500200054007200610069006E0065007200730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s right! With Purrloin, every day is a thrill!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006100742019007300200072006900670068007400210020005700690074006800200050007500720072006C006F0069006E002C00200065007600650072007900200064006100790020006900730020006100200074006800720069006C006C002100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm... I remember Purrloin being more carefree\nthan that.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002E002E002E00200049002000720065006D0065006D00620065007200200050007500720072006C006F0069006E0020006200650069006E00670020006D006F00720065002000630061007200650066007200650065000A007400680061006E00200074006800610074002E00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You must know the move that Purrloin\nsurprisingly can’t learn on its own, right?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Torment",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F0072006D0065006E00740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nasty Plot",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006100730074007900200050006C006F00740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Foul Play",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F0075006C00200050006C006100790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yup! You’d think Purrloin would be able to learn\nthat move, but it can’t! Funny, isn’t it?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Really? I’m pretty sure Purrloin learns that move...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005200650061006C006C0079003F002000492019006D00200070007200650074007400790020007300750072006500200050007500720072006C006F0069006E0020006C006500610072006E0073002000740068006100740020006D006F00760065002E002E002E00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Meooow!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065006F006F006F007700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s so fun talking with someone else who loves\nPurrloin! I could keep going for hours!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "W-well, Félidie...it seems like Purrloin enjoys your\ncompany...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 3980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057002D00770065006C006C002C0020004600E9006C0069006400690065002E002E002E006900740020007300650065006D00730020006C0069006B006500200050007500720072006C006F0069006E00200065006E006A006F0079007300200079006F00750072000A0063006F006D00700061006E0079002E002E002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Meooow!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065006F006F006F007700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And...I’ve enjoyed your company too!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo, it’d be great if we could maybe go out again\nsometime...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm... Well, you didn’t know enough about\nPurrloin for us to really have a fun chat.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo, yeah... Take care!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The requester blacked out!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065002000720065007100750065007300740065007200200062006C00610063006B006500640020006F0075007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sure thing!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’d love to chat about Purrloin again!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 4632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530075007200650020007400680069006E0067002100100001BE01000A0049201900640020006C006F0076006500200074006F00200063006800610074002000610062006F0075007400200050007500720072006C006F0069006E00200061006700610069006E002100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Meooow! ♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 4748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065006F006F006F007700210020266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Th-thank you! I’ll...be right back.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 4768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068002D007400680061006E006B00200079006F00750021002000492019006C006C002E002E002E006200650020007200690067006800740020006200610063006B002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re a real lifesaver... I had no idea what she\nwas talking about...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 4848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks to you...I’ll be meeting up with her again!\nI’m forever grateful!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll have to say goodbye to her now. I just hope\nshe doesn’t start talking about Purrloin again...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 5364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m still nervous, but if I can’t think of anything to\nsay, I’ll ask Félidie about the things that she likes.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMaybe I’ll start opening up a little bit to her, too...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
